  "name": "Demo 13 (order to cash): software order",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Order to cash for software: from the signed contract to revenue\nOne call per system, in the order of the process: CRM, order, material, entitlement, provisioning, billing, revenue. Every HTTP node **reads or posts through the system's own interface and returns a record**; the workflow decides nothing.\n**Three places where a person decides** (Wait nodes, resumed by a webhook call): the deviations of the entitlement check, the customer's confirmation of receipt, the true-up of consumption. Whoever resumes the run is recorded in the run history of n8n.\n**Setup:** set the environment variables `CRM_URL`, `ORDER_URL`, `MATERIAL_URL`, `ENTITLEMENT_URL`, `PROVISIONING_URL`, `BILLING_URL`, `REVENUE_URL` and `O2C_API_KEY` (keep the key out of the workflow). n8n must allow `$env` in expressions (`N8N_BLOCK_ENV_ACCESS_IN_NODE=false`). Start the run with a POST to `/webhook/o2c-software` and `{\"contractId\": \"C-4410\"}`.\n**Not tested against real systems.** The seven systems in the Space are fictional; the URLs and tool paths here only show the order and the shape of the calls.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 820,
        "color": 4
      },
